Pitboard never performs or automates sign-in to a Claude or an OpenAI account, and never
makes a sign-in from a tool's login. Signing in to a tool happens through that tool's own
flow, run by you.

In the app's account windows, you sign in to claude.ai or chatgpt.com on the site's own
pages. Pitboard never reads, copies or changes the session that results. The system's web
engine, WebKit on macOS and WebView2 on Windows, keeps it on your computer in that
account's website data, as a browser keeps its own.

